# Every pull request requests a review from @samppagit.
#
# GitHub never requests a review from the PR's own author, so this does not
# nag samppagit about their own PRs -- it only fires for the other org
# members, which is the point: nobody else's change reaches main unreviewed.
#
# A code owner must have write access to be requested. samppagit is repo
# admin. mollsam has read, which is enough to REVIEW but not to be an owner,
# so they are deliberately not listed here.
#
# This requests the review. It does not BLOCK merging on it -- that needs a
# branch protection rule or ruleset on main, which is not set up, because
# requiring a PR on main would stop monthly-fetch.yml pushing its data
# straight there unless github-actions[bot] is given a bypass.
#
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

* @samppagit
